    {
      "type": "Block",
      "value": "---\nesid: sec-temporal.zoneddatetime.prototype.gettimezonetransition\ndescription: >\n  Named time zones without DST return null for getTimeZoneTransition in\n  directions where no transitions exist.\ninfo: |\n  GetNamedTimeZoneNextTransition and GetNamedTimeZonePreviousTransition should\n  return null when no transition is found within the search window. This tests\n  time zones that have no future transitions and time zones queried from dates\n  before any historical transitions.\nfeatures: [Temporal]\n---",
      "start": 128,
      "end": 635
    },
    {
      "type": "Line",
      "value": " Asia/Riyadh has no DST transitions. It has one historical LMT-to-standard",
      "start": 637,
      "end": 713
    },
    {
      "type": "Line",
      "value": " transition but no DST. From 2024, there should be no next transition.",
      "start": 714,
      "end": 786
    },
    {
      "type": "Line",
      "value": " From a date before any IANA transitions, \"previous\" should return null.",
      "start": 1003,
      "end": 1077
    }
  ]
